writeValue in showText
writeValue invokes console.writeLine
writeValue argument text String text lend
writeValue result none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError
writeValue suppresses console.WriteError.failed

argumentReader is capability
argumentReader purpose "Authority to read the command-line arguments"
argumentReader grants read process.arguments none

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect read process.arguments
main effect write console.stdout
main uses argumentReader
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap true
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label showFirstStep loopKind none
main label showFirstStep within none
main label outOfRange loopKind none
main label outOfRange within none
main label showBad loopKind none
main label showBad within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main let first Int64 0 immutable
main let sixth Int64 5 immutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main let failCode ExitCode 1 immutable
main at begin do countArguments
main at begin do showCount
main at begin do readFirst
main at begin branch ifError readFirst goto failed else goto showFirstStep
main at showFirstStep do showFirst
main at showFirstStep do readSixth
main at showFirstStep branch ifError readSixth goto outOfRange else goto failed
main at outOfRange match sixthError process.ArgumentError
main at outOfRange case process.ArgumentError.outOfRange bind badIndex Int64 goto showBad
main at showBad do printBad
main at showBad return ok okCode
main at failed return ok failCode

